OpenQuantum transformed the published JSON record arrays into a local indexed
snapshot and deduplicated identical complete records, retaining all file/index
locations and source-file SHA-256 values. No metrics have been aggregated or
recalculated. The source-file inventory and transformation scope are recorded in
source.json; the original license is included in LICENSE.

Attribution and source links are returned with every lookup. Dataset inclusion
and its published outcomes do not constitute OpenQuantum scientific acceptance
or verification of present device performance. Local simulator entries retain
their source provider labels.
